## Seletores 2 ##

<style>
 optgroup, option {
   font-size: x-large;
 }
</style>


<div class="col75p terminal example cozy">&lt;select size=12 name=tamanho>
    <code class=focus>&lt;optgroup label=Grande></code>
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=9</code>>XXXL
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=8</code>>XXL
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=7</code>>XL
    <code class=focus>&lt;/optgroup></code>
    <code class=focus>&lt;optgroup label=Normal></code>
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=6</code>>L
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=5</code>>M
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=4</code>>S
    <code class=focus>&lt;/optgroup></code>
    <code class=focus>&lt;optgroup label=Pequeno></code>
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=3</code>>XS
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=2</code>>XXS
       &lt;option <code class=focus>value=1</code>>XXS
    <code class=focus>&lt;/optgroup></code>
&lt;/select>
</div>
<div class=col25p>
<select size=12 name=tamanho>
    <optgroup label=Grande>
       <option value=9>XXXL
       <option value=8>XXL
       <option value=7>XL
    </optgroup>
    <optgroup label=Normal>
       <option value=6>L
       <option value=5>M
       <option value=4>S
    </optgroup>
    <optgroup label=Pequeno>
       <option value=3>XS
       <option value=2>XXS
       <option value=1>XXS
    </optgroup>
</select>
</div>
<div class=endCols style="margin-bottom: -20px;">&nbsp;</div>

* Seletores podem ter opções agrupadas com <code class=focus>optgroup</code>
* Opções com valor diferente da etiqueta usando atributo <code class=focus>value</code>
* Anotação de fecho de <code class=focus>option</code> pode ser omitida